        "content": "## STAGE 1 — SOURCING (Apollo)\nApollo People Search replaces the old Google CSE + Apify scraper.\nOne API call = search + profile data. No scraping fragility, no pagination dorking.\n\nPage cursor is persisted in an n8n Data Table so runs resume where they left off.",
