      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STAGE 2 — AI LEAD SCORING (n8n)\nLLM agent scores each lead 0–10 against the ICP rubric with a structured-output parser (auto-fix on).\n\nDecision: scoring stays in n8n (cheap, version-controlled prompt). Clay only gets leads worth spending enrichment credits on.",
